	<aura:description>
    <p>Marquee Combined Component</p>

    <!-- LAST UPDATED DATE / VERSION -->
    <p>Last Updated: 7/1/2019</p>
    <p>CurrentVersion: 1</p>

		<p>
				Marquee Component that replaces almost all marquees on the styleguide. Except for Marquee_L3 that has different set of data altogether.
		</p>
		<p>
				Sizes: Choose from 4 sizes: x-short, short, medium, tall
		</p>
		<p>
				Types determine which breadcrumb data to use on which page. There is only 1 special page which is l2search that changes the heading/subheading based on redux search type and category
				l0, l1, l2search, compare, myoffering, editlead, generic
		</p>
	
		<hr/>

